        "original_id": "cd6c6d04-7b58-567d-b35c-fe1f1048ba9c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: George Juskalian\n- Events: Operation Torch, World War II, North African Campaign\n- Topics: Infantry service, Allied invasion of French North Africa\n\nFacts:\n- On 8 November 1942, Operation Torch began as the British-United States invasion of French North Africa during the North African Campaign of World War II.\n- Operation Torch was initially called Operation Gymnast.\n- During World War II, George Juskalian served with the infantry in the North African Campaign.\n- During World War II, George Juskalian took part in Operation Torch.",
